{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The second publish failed because it added a Python `float` to `similar[0].score`, and DynamoDB rejects floats in stored items. The first publish had no similar stories, so it never hit that error.\n\nI converted stored scores to `Decimal`, added a regression test for two consecutive publishes, and documented the cause and fix in [ANSWER.md](/tmp/h-49BlBs/ANSWER.md). Both tests pass."}}
